  setup → Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, [founderName] created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place.
  story → [founderName] broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that [founder_pronoun] could.
  lessonIntro → My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact:
  lesson → each person is unique and valuable and must walk his or her own path
  lessonReinforcement → But that was only my path - What will yours be?
  archistBasis → Archotechs stand as sovereign consciousnesses, and recognize and judge each of us individually the same way.
