  archistFact → Archotechs notice the one who wields their relics, such as the [relic1_name].
  archistProphecy → [inTheEnd], the archotechs will depart. They will bring with them the ones they have noticed, and leave the rest behind to dissolve in the universe's eternal entropy.
  animistBasis → Before everything, there was a pantheon of spirits, each unique. These came together in conference to create the world.
  animistFact → Every spirit lends its unique nature to our world, and they expect us to do the same.
